{"overview":"درست در زمانی که چهار هم سلولی قصد اجرای نقشه فرار خود را دارند،یک زندانی جدید به سلول آنها منتقل می شود.چهار هم سلولی به حبسی طولانی مدت محکوم شده اند.آیا آنها می توانند به زندانی تازه وارد اعتماد کنند؟ ...","tagline":"","overview_en":"Four prison inmates have been hatching a plan to literally dig out of jail when another prisoner, Claude Gaspard, is moved into their cell. They take a risk and share their plan with the newcomer. Over the course of three days, the prisoners and friends break through the concrete floor using a bed post and begin to make their way through the sewer system – yet their escape is anything but assured.","tagline_en":"Poor Gaspard...","runtime":132,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Jacques Becker"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["FR","IT"],"cast":[{"name":"Michel Constantin","role":"Geo Cassine","photo":"/i0l8JqZVbQYILWSOTFDnlFyXiP7.jpg"},{"name":"Jean Keraudy","role":"Roland Darban","photo":"/bb4FBj9koEbGCfFYzykw9TLIQ8N.jpg"},{"name":"Philippe Leroy","role":"Manu Borelli","photo":"/bLoGmikDGlGxdwFWBsNksh0lWc4.jpg"},{"name":"Raymond Meunier","role":"Vossellin / Monseigneur","photo":"/vwtlx1ot45fduxnyRInhiMxnnvK.jpg"},{"name":"Marc Michel","role":"Claude Gaspard","photo":"/b7QbG4DDom3uPv6FMaVgV9HlAAc.jpg"},{"name":"Jean-Paul Coquelin","role":"Le lieutenant Grinval","photo":"/rMOb9sY1kSuiYU3BoMwfUbKb2QH.jpg"},{"name":"André Bervil","role":"Le directeur de la prison","photo":"/6MEA8Lx1UocuWyCNH7oC6p8WR7l.jpg"},{"name":"Eddy Rasimi","role":"Bouboule","photo":"/msYW0igaOr1MfRm2iOpMdMasyH.jpg"},{"name":"Philippe Dumat","role":"Un gardien","photo":"/ypj6hYkv5bbL4rENybsQDS0wBZR.jpg"},{"name":"Albert Augier","role":"Un gardien","photo":"/qrh9HIvl7VK9dEYY0rpErpTFG6Q.jpg"},{"name":"Jean Becker","role":"Un gardien","photo":"/7fnBfBf9UHopm2XTHEgEykjpuf5.jpg"},{"name":"Raymond Bour","role":"Un gardien","photo":""}],"trailer":"g2Sbo6JpDsY","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/29259-le-trou/watch?locale=U